deferred-sync Repository Version History
========================================

v26.07 (2026-07-31)
-------------------
- Replace awk {n,} interval expression in usage() with a portable equivalent for mawk compatibility.
- Accept nosudo, --no-sudo, and -n as no-sudo arguments in install.sh.
- Propagate install.sh exit statuses consistently, including a nonzero status for unknown options.
- Document the -v and --version options and the absolute path requirement for the install target.
- Correct the schedule comment in the deferred-sync cron.d sample, including the Saturday typo.
- Remove the unused EXECDIR assignment in exec/deferred-sync.
- Align the mail fallback note in exec/deferred-sync with the implementation.
- Resolve the remote backup directory with hostname in sync.conf, since $HOSTNAME is unset under POSIX sh.
- Preserve yum failures when a later old-kernel cleanup succeeds.
- Preserve apt failures in 20_system_upgrade when the yum path also runs and succeeds.
- Fix stale dump cleanup in 30_dump_mysql to target .sql.gz instead of .zip.
- Correct the credential handling note in the 30_dump_mysql header.
- Confine the working directory change in 31_dump_postgresql to a subshell so it no longer leaks into subsequently sourced plugins.
- Fix 32_dump_mongodb removing its own required temp directory after a successful dump.
- Correct the SVN dump description in the 35_dump_svn header.
- Correct the exclude filter comment in 70_incremental_backup to match the implementation.
- Change unreachable host return code to 2 in 85_get_remote_dir to distinguish from other failures.
- Document that an explicit install target skips cron, logrotate, and backup directory setup.
- Document that the /etc/cron.exec symlink always targets the default installation path.
- Correct the README directory structure and document plugin ordering and name matching.
- Document the return codes of plugins that propagate an external command status.

v26.05 (2026-05-26)
-------------------
- Exclude additional backup storage directories.

v26.03 (2026-03-28)
-------------------
