v25.10 (2025-10-24)
-------------------
- Refine core load sequence to return instead of exit, adopting warn-and-continue behavior on nonzero plugin failures.
- Standardize plugin scripts to propagate return codes and aggregate failures across backup, dump, and remote sync operations.
- Document standardized return code convention (0=OK,1=fail,2=network,3=local prerequisite) across core and plugins.
- Harden log mail delivery: stream JOBLOG, fall back when `nkf` is unavailable, and report failures explicitly.
- Restrict plugin loading to regular files (`-f`) for safety.
- Simplify upgrade logic by removing redundant network reachability checks.
- Add lspci support to hardware info plugin.
- Add server_alive_check plugin to run server_alive_check if available.

v25.09 (2025-09-26)
-------------------
- Add thinclient_drives to exclude list.
- Unify deferred sync log rotation policy to 90 daily rotations.

v25.08 (2025-08-20)
-------------------
